  dir_target_err_unsupported.pcpp - break step of dir_target.pcpp: a
  well-formed triple that is not an official target (the report names the
  two supported ones; it is not applied)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_target_err_unsupported.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_target_err_unsupported.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
